# Line endings are LF everywhere — in the repo and in every working tree.
# Without this, a Windows clone (core.autocrlf=true) checks the tree out as CRLF
# and Prettier (endOfLine: lf) then rejects every file. eol=lf also forces LF in
# the working tree on checkout, so the setting holds regardless of local git config.
* text=auto eol=lf
